5Z"},"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-02-09T18:50:37Z","updated_at":"2025-02-10T19:26:32Z","closed_at":"2025-02-10T18:27:41Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102627","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102627","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102627.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102627.patch","merged_at":"2025-02-10T18:27:41Z"},"body":"The C# Android export template includes `.jar` dependencies from .NET 8.0, so other TFMs are not supported.\r\n\r\n- Context: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98066#issuecomment-2616118758\r\n\r\nThe error messages assume https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98066 will be merged so this won't be a problem for Gradle builds.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI don't like that we keep introducing more .NET-specific stuff on the Android platform. Maybe we can expose some virtual method on [`EditorExportPlugin`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/36d90c73a843afa2807a0b8dcbfbf52bdb8a759c/doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml) to do this validation on the plugin's side, then it could be implemented entirely on [`ExportPlugin.cs`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/36d90c73a843afa2807a0b8dcbfbf52bdb8a759c/modules/mono/editor/GodotTools/GodotTools/Export/ExportPlugin.cs), but this can be postponed to 4.5+.\r\n\r\n*Bugsquad edit:*\r\n- Together with #98066, fixes #101948.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repite